      "chat_id": "oc_1a69bd0b7709507918dd2a27852c5ea2",
      "chat_type": "p2p",
      "message_type": "text",
      "content": "{\"text\":\"@_user_1 先做只读体检：状态、更新通道、深度安全审计；确认无明显阻塞后再升级。\\n\\n需要你先批准这组只读检测命令，我再继续升级。  \\n请直接回复：\\n\\n/approve 880c94d1 allow-once\\n\\n将执行的完整命令如下：\\n```sh\\nset -o pipefail\\n{\\n  echo '### openclaw status --deep';\\n  openclaw status --deep;\\n  echo;\\n  echo '### openclaw update status';\\n  openclaw update status;\\n  echo;\\n  echo '### openclaw security audit --deep';\\n  openclaw security audit --deep;\\n}\\n```  \\n批准后我会先做整体框架检查，再执行升级，最后做自我排查。  我批准了 开始处理\"}",
      "mentions": [
        {
          "key": "@_user_1",
          "id": {
            "user_id": "",
            "open_id": "ou_19c9ad75ddcc264feb16cb2497913b2b",
